post.description:
Attach an EXISTING photographer to additional projects (link-only): no new
account, no email. Used by the All-Projects photographers panel.

Body: { photographerId: str, projectIds: int[] }

patch.description:
Super-admin endpoint.
Edits role defaults (insert/delete) for a project, enforcing global locks.

Expected body:
{
  "role": "photographer",
  "changes": {
    "sharelinks.create": true,
    "images.delete": false
  }
}

Super-admin endpoint.
Edits user-specific permissions (upsert) for a project, enforcing global locks.

Expected body:
{
  "role": "photographer",
  "user_id": "user_target",
  "changes": {
    "sharelinks.create": true,
    "images.delete": false
  }
}
